  "description": "OEDRO Custom fit for the 2024-2025 Subaru Crosstrek, these floor mats feature advanced 3D laser scanning for precise fitment, ensuring safety and comfort by preventing pedal interference. Made from GRS-certified TPE, they’re durable, odorless, and ideal for all-weather protection. The stylish design seamlessly matches your vehicle’s interior while effectively containing dirt, mud, and spills. Easy to clean, these mats are backed by over 10 years of professional experience, offering reliable protection you can trust.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit for 2024-2025 Crosstrek: Advanced 3D laser scanning ensures a precise, glove-like fit for a safer driving experience.\nDurable TPE Material: Made from GRS-certified, recyclable TPE, these mats are safe, odorless, and pet-friendly for all-weather protection.\nStylish & Functional Design: Unique patterns inspired by your Crosstrek’s interior, combining aesthetics with superior stain retention.\nAll-Weather Protection: Edge-to-edge coverage fully contains mud, snow, sand, and spills; easy to clean by simply shaking off and hosing down.\nTrusted Quality: Backed by 10+ years of expertise in auto floor mats, ensuring dependable protection and customer satisfaction.\n2 years warranty. For your safety, professional installation recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2024-2025 Subaru Crosstrek\nDoes not fit vehicles with vinyl flooring",
